  m_text: "<b>HOW TO PLAY:</b>\n1. Adjust your Total Bet ($10 - $500) or click MAX.\n2. Pull the lever on the right to spin the 3 reels.\n3. Match 3 identical symbols along the center payline to win!\n\n<b>SYMBOL PAYTABLE:</b>\n\u2022 3x Lucky Seven (777)  ->  <b>100x Bet</b>\n\u2022 3x Golden Bell        ->  <b>50x Bet + 5 FREE SPINS (2x Win)</b>\n\u2022 3x Sweet Cherries     ->  <b>25x Bet</b>\n\u2022 3x Classic Bar        ->  <b>10x Bet</b>\n\n<i>Bonus Feature: Free Spins automatically trigger 5 consecutive free rounds with all payouts doubled!</i>"
